{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["B.B BURNING BLOOD","One night after leaving a club where he was playing trumpet, Ryou Takagi is jumped by a motorcycle gang. The scuffle spills out into the streets and causes a traffic accident. Because of this, Ryou is arrested and forced to do time. Upon his release, he has developed into a skilled boxer but trouble continues to find him."],"ja":["Ｂ・Ｂ BURNING BLOOD",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-9177","ids":{"shikimori":9177,"mal":9177,"anilist":9177,"kodik":"serial-36534"},"kodikIds":["serial-45307","serial-36534"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-45307":"2022-08-31T19:45:21Z","serial-36534":"2021-08-13T09:18:31Z"},"title":"Бурлящая кровь","originalTitle":"Burning Blood","alt":"Ｂ・Ｂ BURNING BLOOD","description":"Ре Такаги - трубач, который вот-вот добьется успеха со своей группой, но он также прирожденный боец, чья кровь начинает гореть, когда он дерется всерьез; это дало ему прозвище Би Би (\"Горящая кровь\"). Однако, потерпев абсолютное поражение от молодого человека по имени Дзин Морияма, Ре решает обменять свою трубу на пару боксерских перчаток, чтобы провести матч-реванш так, как этого хочет Морияма: на боксерском ринге.","year":1990,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Спорт","спортивные единоборства"],"rating":6.16,"popularity":1177,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/9177/c13433d471545ede48313997dc934369.jpeg","width":249,"height":378},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/2935adf6e302c44fc397088fca80739509d854f1.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-963","dubId":"963","label":"Amazing Dubbing","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-45307","translationId":"963","url":